, the removable covers are easy to care for, and the low, clean silhouette fits a small apartment as comfortably as a large living room. :: Short: Setting the bar as one of the most comfortable sofas in its class, the Asgaard is a compact, sturdy three-seater with a solid-wood frame and deep, soft cushions.\nDescription ¶1: Embodying the relaxed, honest spirit of Scandinavian design, the Asgaard pairs a solid-wood frame with soft, hard-wearing upholstery, built to be lived on every day.\nDescription ¶2: Weighing in at 45 kg, the Asgaard is sturdy without being bulky. Its high-density foam cushions keep their shape, the removable covers are easy to care for, and the low, clean silhouette fits a small apartment as comfortably as a large living room.\n   FRAME 14:93 Cart (04, 06, 07)\n    TEXT 14:94 Cart (04, 06, 07) :: Cart (04, 06, 07)\n    TEXT 14:95 Asgaard sofa · 1 × Rs. 250,000.00 (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa) Subtotal Rs. 250,000.00 · Total Rs. 250,000.00 :: Asgaard sofa · 1 × Rs. 250,000.00 (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa)\nSubtotal Rs. 250,000.00 · Total Rs. 250,000.00\n   FRAME 14:96 Comparison (05) · products\n    TEXT 14:97 Comparison (05) · products :: Comparison (05) · products\n    TEXT 14:98 Asgaard Sofa · Rs. 250,000.00 · 4.7 · 204 Review (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa) Outdoor Sofa Set · Rs. 224,000.00 · 4.2 · 145 Review (Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set) :: Asgaard Sofa · Rs. 250,000.00 · 4.7 · 204 Review (Photo_Asgaard_Sofa)\nOutdoor Sofa Set · Rs. 224,000.00 · 4.2 · 145 Review (Photo_Outdoor_Sofa_Set)\n   FRAME 14:99 Comparison (05) · General / Product\n    TEXT 14:100 Comparison (05) · General / Product :: Comparison (05) · General / Product\n    TEXT 14:101 Values: Asgaard Sofa | Outdoor Sofa Set General Sales Package: 1 sectional sofa | 1 Three Seater, 2 Single Seater Model Number: TFCBLIGRBL6SRHS | DTUBLIGRBL568 Secondary Material: Solid Wood | Solid Wood Configuration: L-shaped | L-shaped Upholstery Material: Fabric + Cotton | Fabric + Cotton Upholstery Color: Bright Grey & Lion | Bri