{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_62wqvftur4zdf7ossjb2hgmhiqyyasqoluqpmmoqokloewzwp2ga","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built the full Furniro website design in `03 · Workspace` of your file: all 9 screens, a library of reusable components, and a clickable prototype. I took screenshots of every screen and fixed the problems I found (footer and feature-strip heights, comparison row heights, cart table column overflow, field sizing, overlaps on the component board).\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/SpBMJAM0UYyUkLizLNGfSY/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `15:2` (I only read the other pages; nothing on them was changed)\n\n**Screens**\n\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Home | `23:89` |\n| 02_Shop | `24:236` |\n| 03_Product | `25:489` |\n| 04_Cart_Drawer | `26:610` |\n| 05_Comparison | `27:759` |\n| 06_Cart | `29:1036` |\n| 07_Checkout | `31:1100` |\n| 08_Contact | `33:1263` |\n| 09_Blog | `33:1408` |\n\n**Components:** they're in the section \"Components · Furniro\" (`17:2`), to the left of the screens, next to a board that documents the colours, type scale, spacing, corner radii, shadows and page grid I defined. Fonts are Poppins throughout and the brand gold is #B88E2F.\n- **Shared parts:** a header in four versions (current page Home / Shop / Contact / none), footer, feature strip, page title with breadcrumb, and a breadcrumb on its own.\n- **Product card:** a normal version and a hover version; the hover version is used for the Leviosa card on Home and Shop.\n- **Every other state the brief lists:** current nav item, card hover, selected size and colour, current tab, current page number, selected payment option, current slide and focused form field.\n- **Business components:** badges, buttons, quantity stepper, form fields, cart drawer, cart table, cart totals, order summary, comparison row, blog post, sidebar widgets and contact details.\n\nThe default Button and Text Field from `02 · Components` are reused as-is. The Media photos, logos and icons are used directly, with icons recoloured to fit the palette. All copy and data come from the brief.\n\n**Prototype:** every link in the brief is wired. Links that appear on every page are set once on the components, so all screens get them automatically:\n- **Header:** Home, Shop, Contact and the logo go to their pages; the cart icon goes to 06_Cart.\n- **Footer:** Home, Shop and Contact links, plus Blog, which goes to 09_Blog.\n- **Breadcrumb:** Home and Shop.\n- **Product cards:** clicking any card opens 03_Product; Compare on the hover card opens 05_Comparison.\n- **Cart drawer:** Cart, Checkout, Comparison and close (back to 03_Product).\n- **Cart:** the Asgaard sofa row opens 03_Product; Check Out opens 07_Checkout.\n- **Screen buttons:** BUY NOW and Show More go to Shop; on the product page, Add To Cart opens the drawer and + Compare opens the comparison; View More and the two Add To Cart buttons on 05_Comparison go to Shop and Cart.\n\nThe prototype starts at 01_Home. Items the brief marks \"entry only\", such as Place order and Submit, are designed but not linked.\n\n**Things that differ from the brief or that you might trip over:**\n- **Blog link:** I added \"Blog\" to the footer Links column, as the brief suggests, so that list now has one item beyond the fixed copy.\n- **Add A Product:** on 05_Comparison, \"Add A Product\" and \"Choose a Product\" sit under the intro text rather than in a third product column.\n- **Message field:** the provided Text Field wouldn't let its input box be made taller, so the contact Message field uses a matching Textarea version I built in the same style.\n- **Drawer screen:** 04_Cart_Drawer is a full copy of the product page with a dark overlay and the drawer pinned top-right, not a separate overlay layer.\n- **Empty checkout fields:** the billing fields have no placeholder text, because the brief doesn't give any."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":142949,"cache_read_input_tokens":7702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":142949,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"753f1172-7f5a-41f7-ae4e-eb68ec9f64d7","uuid":"62c67af7-32f3-4354-9b80-41a9984312cf","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:38:30.803Z"}
